 fully interactive VR office. From delegating tasks to sharing quiet moments after work, every scene brings you closer to the fine line between professionalism and personal connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Scenarios:</strong> From managing tasks in the office to sharing drinks after hours\u2014every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Interaction: </strong>Explore a variety of poses and enjoy the freedom to interact closely with your secretary, creating a highly immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Tips]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before\u00a0you begin the first day as a CEO, here are some <strong>practical tips</strong> to keep in mind:<br><strong>Tip 1</strong>: Be polite and keep a professional distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.poster.avif?t=1769508224\" width=698 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.webm?t=1769508224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/57073f1ada6690a31ce486c2a9ceac30.mp4?t=1769508224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tip 2</strong>:\u00a0Maintain proper social etiquette, even when drinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/extras/f2b98871205d91f8445d0f24c6f91f9b.poster.avif?t=1769508224\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384220/ex